      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF.",
      "pt": "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "msgctxt": "514632",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF.",
      "pt": "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "msgctxt": "514716",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game.",
      "pt": "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "msgctxt": "514796",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving.",
      "pt": "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "msgctxt": "514864",
      "tipo": "unk_op1653",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Would you like to save your Clear Data?",
      "pt": "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "msgctxt": "514904",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "Are you sure you wish to exit",
      "pt": "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "msgctxt": "514936",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "without saving the Clear Data?",
      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "msgctxt": "514968",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The noises are incessant,\nlike small insects buzzing past my ear.\nLike trees shaking and shaking in a storm.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "msgctxt": "515080",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "What is that unpleasant commotion!?\nSuch cacophonies shouldn't be blaring\nthroughout her mind so!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "msgctxt": "515180",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Some would call this \"tone-deafness,\"\nwhich isn't out of character for her.\nStill, the noise we're hearing isn't normal.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "msgctxt": "515304",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My ears! My ears are going to fall OFFFFF!\nWhat is this noise!? It's like a saw cutting\nthrough scrap iron served on a plate!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "msgctxt": "515432",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This is a tormenting noise. It tortures,\noppresses, reproaches, and drives away.\nSo, the consumer was the one being consumed.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "515560",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The subconscious tells no lies. A dragon on the\nverge of death, swarmed with ants…\nI deem this to be her true nature.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "515680",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This noise resembles that of a harpoon\nas it slices through the air.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "515752",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Piercing with an arrow;\nslashing with a sword;\nbinding with a chain.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "515824",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Enough! Don't you gnaw at me――!\nDon't you gnaw away at me!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "515888",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It hurts… It's so loud…!\nMy ears are going to bleed to the sounds\nof my breaking apart like this!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "515988",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Is this headache my own doing?\nOr are you all setting me up?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "516052",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This noise represents her innermost agony, as if\nshe was doomed to go insane from the beginning.\nIt would explain her emotional instability.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "516196",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Horn-girl's destructive urges didn't stem from\nher brash nature, but from deep frustration.\nThis constant noise ate away at her brain.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "516332",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "From both, naturally. Noblesse oblige left her\nvulnerable to the ailings of her peasants――\nleaving her a sorry animal in body and mind.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "516472",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You can hear me…?\nYou filthy #RUBS  beasts#RUBEanimals#REND are trying to take\neverything from me!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "516572",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The#RUBS  pigs#RUBE men#REND that devoured my chastity!\nThe#ROFS0002#RUBSsquirrels#RUBE women#REND that hoarded my jewels!\nThe#RUBS rabbit#RUBE time#REND that ran off with my beauty!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "516756",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "To shine their dirty little teeth,\nthey bit into #RUBS          my dragon scales#RUBEme#REND.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "516852",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It hurt. It itched. It felt dirty. I was scared. \nFather said this was a part of womanhood――\na duty. Coldly, he told me to endure.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "516988",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Ha! Haha…! Ahahaaahahaha!\nWell, now that that bile is out of my system,\nI get to be the lord of my OWN castle!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "517100",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Revenge. This is my revenge on the insects that\nreaped on my body――you incessant whiners who\ndid all but fester your days away!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "517232",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\"Be beautiful,\" the insects told me. Very well!\nIf they so wish it, who better to serve as\nthe compost to my flourish?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "517352",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "How exhilarating. As if they were on my plate,\nI pinched them between my fingers and\ncrushed them!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "517452",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "With the tip of my nail, I smashed.\nWith my heel, I grinded!\nWith my sharp lance, I SHREDDED!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "517548",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hee, hee, hee!\nHee, hee, hee, hee!\nAha-hahaha-hahaha hahaha-hahaha-hahahaaa!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "517628",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Just the recollection of it heals me!\nThat was the first time the discord\never stopped.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "517716",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I slaughtered countless peasants.\nShame I don't remember how.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "517780",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Because every day, I would courteously\nchange how it was done for them!\nCould I be any more sincere?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "517884",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "All I remember is the fresh taste of human\nblood. I'm a dragon girl, after all. What's\nwrong with me making food out of my prey!?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "518016",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That's the biggest difference between you and I.\nYes, I'm a tyrant. But the love I gave my people\nwas without par, even amongst wise emperors.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "518160",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It's a shame, evil dragon.\nYou never loved your people, even once. I fear\nyou'll never be reborn as a human being.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "518276",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've heard enough. Cover your ears, Master.\nShe recognizes her sins, yet touts that she's,\nconceitedly, justified…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "518392",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "How warped can a noble young girl be?\nNo wonder she devolved herself into\nthe likes of a vampire.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "518492",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I won't listen to this. Darling, she keeps\nsquawking about this and that.\nI believe it best we ignore her entirely.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "518608",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Her words are shrieks and nothing more. That\nnoise is her guilt, made manifest. The more she\ntwists the truth, the less we can do for her.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "518748",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "So, dragons attack humans? Certainly, Dragon and\nMan don't mesh well, but humans often have the\nmost to win or lose from instigating.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "518884",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But this woman sought out humans to engage. She\nis as low, low, low as a dragon could get. I'd\nbe shocked if even other dragons accepted her.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "519028",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Ahh! So loud… so loud…!\nI don't know why, but it's… noisier than usual\ntoday…!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "msgctxt": "519112",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Someone's cheeky today.\nFor a Servant, you sure are an eyesore…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "msgctxt": "519180",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\"Regret\"?\nWhy would I feel something like that?\nAs if I'd ever let that get to me…!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "msgctxt": "519268",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Exploitation is my duty as a noble.\nWhat is torture if not noblesse oblige?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "msgctxt": "519344",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Is that so wrong? What's so bad about it!?\nI was just protecting the Báthory family's―\nand my―fortune!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "msgctxt": "519452",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "All I did was fulfill my duty.\nI had to quell the awful noises.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "msgctxt": "519516",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Everyone… everyone should be smashed and wrung\ninto a warm bath of fresh blood, just for me.\nAll my people need to do is warm my soft skin.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "msgctxt": "519660",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…I won't lose. Even if this body completely\ntransforms into a dragon. Even if the insects\nswarming this body multiply.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "msgctxt": "519780",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "――――I'll continue to be beautiful.\nI'll keep using the blood of many girls to\npreserve my madness.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "msgctxt": "519884",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That madness――\nIt's the only thing I have left of the woman\nI used to be!",
      "pt": ""
    }
  ]
}
